---
title: RunPickingList State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Issued : picking list issued per warehouse after the SO becomes a PO
    Issued --> Picking : first valid QR batch scan by Warehouse Keeper
    Picking --> Picking : scan validated (warehouse, SKU, batch, quantity within allocation), wrong batch blocked
    Picking --> Ready : every picking line fully picked
    Issued --> NeedsHandling : keeper reports exception before any scan (Shortage/Damaged/Expired/QrMismatch)
    Picking --> NeedsHandling : keeper reports exception (Shortage/Damaged/Expired/QrMismatch)
    NeedsHandling --> Picking : Administrator resolves exception, picking resumes
    Ready --> [*]
